A³-X00TD 4.19 Kernel Source
=============================

Getting Started
---------------
To use this kernel source for building rom, you need clone with this command
```bash
git clone --single-branch --recursive https://github.com/aepranata/kernel_asus_X00TD.git kernel/asus/X00TD
```

To use this kernel source for standalone compile, you need clone with this command
```bash
git clone --single-branch --recursive https://github.com/aepranata/kernel_asus_X00TD.git <kernel-path>
```
